Description: Console art that rolls across your terminal, drawn by an LLM from today's news.
 A homage to sl.
 Like sl, but the picture changes with the news. artsl rolls a piece of
 console art across the terminal: a built-in picture on first run, then the
 picture of the day from mailbuttons.com, drawn each morning by an LLM from
 the headlines. Subscribers can have one drawn on the spot.

